<x-app-layout><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h1>Answers, without the sales fog.</h1></section><div class="faq"><details open><summary>Who is CleanFlow for?</summary><p>Owner-operated residential cleaning businesses and small teams that want a focused enquiry-to-booking workflow.</p></details><details><summary>Can customers pay their cleaning business through CleanFlow?</summary><p>Not in this first release. PayPal is for CleanFlow’s own SaaS subscriptions, not your customers’ cleaning payments.</p></details><details><summary>Does it support more than one currency or time zone?</summary><p>Each business stores its preferred currency, locale, and time zone. The first interface is English; translations can be added later.</p></details><details><summary>Does it send WhatsApp or SMS?</summary><p>No. The initial release uses email only and does not include unconfigured messaging integrations.</p></details></div></x-app-layout>
